     The bbmmttpphhyy driver supports the Broadcom Mini-Theta BCM5201 and BCM5202
     10/100 Ethernet PHYs and their derivatives such as BCM4401, BCM5214, and
     BCM522x.  It also supports the internal PHY on the 3Com 3C905C-TX 10/100
     Ethernet interface, and the internal PHY on some 3Com 3C905B-TX 10/100
     Ethernet interfaces.  These PHYs are found on a variety of Ethernet in‐
     terfaces.

